        "status" : "generated",
        "div" : "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"/><p style=\"border: black 1px dotted; background-color: #EEEEEE; padding: 8px; margin-bottom: 8px\">Expansion performed internally based on <a href=\"CodeSystem-VRM-Status-cs.html\">codesystem Status Codes Values v1.0.1 (CodeSystem)</a></p><p>This value set contains 5 concepts</p><table class=\"codes\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>System</b></td><td><b>Display (en-US)</b></td><td><b>Definition</b></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><a name=\"x-http://cdc.gov/nchs/nvss/fhir/vital-records-messaging/CodeSystem/VRM-Status-cs-manualCauseOfDeathCoding\"> </a>\u00a0\u00a0<a href=\"CodeSystem-VRM-Status-cs.html#VRM-Status-cs-manualCauseOfDeathCoding\">manualCauseOfDeathCoding</a></td><td>http://cdc.gov/nchs/nvss/fhir/vital-records-messaging/CodeSystem/VRM-Status-cs</td><td>Manual Cause of Death Coding</td><td><div><p>The death record has been sent for manual cause of death coding.</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><a name=\"x-http://cdc.gov/nchs/nvss/fhir/vital-records-messaging/CodeSystem/VRM-Status-cs-manualDemographicCoding\"> </a>\u00a0\u00a0<a href=\"CodeSystem-VRM-Status-cs.html#VRM-Status-cs-manualDemographicCoding\">manualDemographicCoding</a></td><td>http://cdc.gov/nchs/nvss/fhir/vital-records-messaging/CodeSystem/VRM-Status-cs</td><td>Manual Demographic  Coding</td><td><div><p>The death record has been sent for manual demographic (race/ethnicity) coding.</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><a name=\"x-http://cdc.gov/nchs/nvss/fhir/vital-records-messaging/CodeSystem/VRM-Status-cs-noCodingNeeded_Duplicate\"> </a>\u00a0\u00a0<a href=\"CodeSystem-VRM-Status-cs.html#VRM-Status-cs-noCodingNeeded_Duplicate\">noCodingNeeded_Duplicate</a></td><td>http://cdc.gov/nchs/nvss/fhir/vital-records-messaging/CodeSystem/VRM-Status-cs</td><td>No Coding Needed - Duplicate</td><td><div><p>The death record is a duplicate of a previously submitted record, no coding will be performed.</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><a name=\"x-http://cdc.gov/nchs/nvss/fhir/vital-records-messaging/CodeSystem/VRM-Status-cs-manualCodingCanceled_Update\"> </a>\u00a0\u00a0<a href=\"CodeSystem-VRM-Status-cs.html#VRM-Status-cs-manualCodingCanceled_Update\">manualCodingCanceled_Update</a></td><td>http://cdc.gov/nchs/nvss/fhir/vital-records-messaging/CodeSystem/VRM-Status-cs</td><td>Manual Coding Canceled - Update</td><td><div><p>An update has been submitted for a death record that is queued for manual coding.  The manual coding\nhas been canceled for the original record.</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><a name=\"x-http://cdc.gov/nchs/nvss/fhir/vital-records-messaging/CodeSystem/VRM-Status-cs-manualCodingCanceled_Void\"> </a>\u00a0\u00a0<a href=\"CodeSystem-VRM-Status-cs.html#VRM-Status-cs-manualCodingCanceled_Void\">manualCodingCanceled_Void</a></td><td>http://cdc.gov/nchs/nvss/fhir/vital-records-messaging/CodeSystem/VRM-Status-cs</td><td>Manual Coding Canceled - Void</td><td><div><p>A void request has been received for a death record that is queued for manual coding.  The manual coding\nhas been canceled for the original record.</p>\n</div></td></tr></table></div>"
